# RTOGuard - System Rules & Constraints
- Language: Python 3.11+
- Frameworks: FastAPI, Pydantic v2, XGBoost, Scikit-learn, Redis, Pytest
- Domain Logic:
  - C_FN (Missed RTO Fraud Cost) = 1200 INR
  - C_FP (False Alarm Customer Friction Cost) = 400 INR
  - Cost Ratio (C_FN / C_FP) = 3.0
- Code Standards:
  - Strictly use type hints (`from typing import Optional, Dict, List, Tuple`).
  - Use Pydantic v2 `BaseModel` for all API schemas.
  - Zero unhandled exceptions: All feature transformers and external calls MUST degrade gracefully to neutral default values on missing or malformed data.
  - Never throw 500 internal server errors from API endpoints; fall back to safe default decisions.

